---
import ProsePage from '../../templates/ProsePage.astro';
---

<ProsePage
  locale="en"
  routeKey="privacy"
  title="Privacy"
  description="This site sets no cookies, loads no third-party scripts and collects no personal data."
>
  <p>Short answer: we collect nothing about you personally.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    None. Not for analytics, not for preferences, not for advertising. Your theme preference (light
    or dark) is stored in <code>localStorage</code> in your own browser and is never transmitted.
  </p>

  <h2>Statistics</h2>
  <p>
    We measure how many people visit which pages through an aggregate counter that cannot
    distinguish individual visitors: no cookies, no fingerprinting, no profiles. That is also why no
    consent banner is needed.
  </p>

  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>
    This site loads no fonts, scripts or images from external domains. Links to other sites
    (vacancies, company websites, meetup pages) do of course take you to those parties, where their
    own privacy policy applies.
  </p>

  <h2>What you submit</h2>
  <p>
    If you submit a job, event or company, that information becomes public in a git repository,
    including its history. So do not put anything in it that should not be public.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    Get in touch via <a href="https://webgrip.nl">Webgrip</a>.
  </p>
</ProsePage>
